      "extract": "arXiv:0711.4229v2 [math.QA] 25 Sep 2013 MODIFIED QUANTUM DIMENSIONS AND RE-NORMALIZED LINK INVARIANTS NATHAN GEER, BERTRAND PATUREAU-MIRAND, AND VLADIMIR TURAEV Abstract. In this paper we give a re-normalization of the Reshetikhin-Turaev quantum invariants of links, by modiﬁed quantum dimensions. In the case of simple Lie algebras these modiﬁed quantum dimensions are proportional to the usual quantum dimensions.",
