      "extract": "One obstruction to applications of quantum link invariants associated with a ribbon category C stems from the fact that certain simple (irreducible) objects of C may have zero quantum dimensions. If the dimension of a simple object V ∈Ob(C) is zero, then the quantum invariants of all (framed oriented) links with components labeled by V are equal to zero. A well known topological trick allows to derive possibly",
